{
  "about": "Named motion presets for use_theme(motion=...). enter: default entrance per element kind (an explicit a='...' on an element wins). ease: curve for fade/draw/grow/wipe/mask/slide. speed: multiplies every entrance duration. trans/trans_dur: default slide transition. cam_dur: how long a camera move (beat cam=) takes.",
  "keynote": {
    "name": "Keynote（默认）",
